  "short_description": "Your pizza. Your name on the lid. Printed pizza boxes in 9 and 12 inch, on kraft or white board.",
  "description": "The box is the last thing your customer sees before the first slice — and it sits on their table for the whole meal. Choose the size, the number of print colours and the board, then make the lid yours.\n\nYour digital proof and print plates are included in the price. Final specifications are confirmed with your written quote.",
  "benefits": [
    "1, 2 or 3 colour print",
    "Kraft or white board",
    "Your own artwork"
  ],
  "faqs": [
    {
      "q": "Can I use my own design?",
      "a": "Yes. Share your logo or print-ready artwork when requesting a quote. We will confirm the artwork requirements for your chosen box, and you approve a digital proof before anything is printed."
    },
    {
      "q": "What if my artwork is not ready?",
      "a": "You can request a quote first and share your artwork later. Tell us what you have in mind and we can discuss the next steps."
    },
    {
      "q": "Are the prices shown final?",
      "a": "The prices on this page are indicative and exclude VAT, which is added at 20%. Your digital proof and print plates are included, and delivery is free to a single UK mainland address. We confirm everything in a written quote before you commit."
    },
    {
      "q": "Do you print other sizes?",
      "a": "This page prices our 9 and 12 inch boxes. If you need another size, use “Request a custom quantity” or contact us with the size and volume and we will quote it."
    },
    {
      "q": "How many print colours do I need?",
      "a": "A one-colour logo is the most cost-effective option and works well on kraft board. Two and three colour prints suit fuller designs. If you are unsure, send us your artwork and we will advise."
    },
    {
      "q": "When will my boxes arrive?",
      "a": "As a general guide, allow several weeks from order confirmation to delivery. We will confirm current timing with your quote."
    }
  ],
